==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[skemmta]]'' meaning "to [[entertain]]" and ''[[sér#Icelandic|sér]]'' the {{dative}} of ''[[sig#Icelandic|sig]]'' meaning "[[oneself]]".

===Verb===
'''[[skemmta]] [[sig#Icelandic|sér]]'''

# to [[enjoy]], to [[have fun]], (''UK'') to [[have a laugh]]
#: ''Heyrðu.. Reyndu allavegana að '''skemmta þér''', okei?''
#:: Listen.. At least try to '''have fun''', OK?

